 ==========================
 C O N C E P T U A L  D F T
 ==========================
  
 Written by L. Joubert & V. Tognetti - Univ.Rouen, France
 All results in a.u. (except dissociation energies in eV)
 All calculations are based on the Frontier Molecular Orbitals (FMO) theory
 Condensed (atomic or diatomic) values are obtained using a QTAIM partition
 of molecular space


